/*******************************************************************************
 * PersonalAccidentNotificationHandler
 *
 * Travel / PersonalAccident / Notification handling. One of ~243 peril handlers registered in PerilHandlerRegistry (registration order matters, see PRB-46468)
 *
 * ORIGINALLY GENERATED BY: POLARIS-2-GW migration toolkit v2.3 (Project Mercury)
 *
